                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16162967" author="agoncharuk" created="Tue, 12 Sep 2017 13:50:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The reason is the following code in GridDhtPartitionMap.java:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; i = 0; i &amp;lt; size; i++) {
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; ordinal = in.readByte();
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; part = in.readShort();
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;which leads to a negative parititon ID.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16164237" author="ainozemtsev" created="Wed, 13 Sep 2017 07:15:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; - this ticket duplicates &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6347&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6347&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16164464" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 13 Sep 2017 10:42:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ainozemtsev&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ainozemtsev&quot;&gt;ainozemtsev&lt;/a&gt; The fix in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6347&quot; title=&quot;Exception in GridDhtPartitionMap.readExternal&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6347&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6347&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is incomplete - there is no test added and the max partition number is not corrected. I will close it when my fix is merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16164467" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 13 Sep 2017 10:43:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
